msgctxt "80"
msgid "Hey, are you all right? Can you tell me what's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "...Will you promise to keep this from Mikio?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Depends on what you say. I'll decide after I hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"The new president of the Commerce Union's been laundering\r\n"
"money, and it all goes to a yakuza family in Kansai. Only I\r\n"
"have the proof to stop him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"To make matters worse, the president is doing anything he\r\n"
"can to close my restaurant and replace it with a supermarket\r\n"
"chain from Kansai."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Huh. So that's why all those Kansai punks are down here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Yes. So just a little while ago, I waited for the president\r\n"
"to leave, and then I took these."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "And those are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"The company ledgers. Soon enough, the president will realize\r\n"
"I stole them, and then he'll most likely go after me... and\r\n"
"my family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"If they find out Mikio's a yakuza and it ends up starting a\r\n"
"war... There'll be hell to pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"So that's why you wanted to send Mikio off to Nagasaki... Out of harm's way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Indeed. I don't care what happens to me, but I can't let anything happen to "
"my family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Now I understand your situation. But the police can't always\r\n"
"move fast enough to stop the yakuza, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Don't worry. I'll watch out for your family. You want to get\r\n"
"those ledgers to the police, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Oh, yes."
msgstr "Oh, sì invece."

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Can you go by yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Yes, I'll go right away. I'm really grateful for this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"(So this runs deeper than a simple family issue... Mikio\r\n"
"should know what's going on. He's probably back at the\r\n"
"Ryudo Family office.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "All right, where are they? Talk!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "I have no idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "If we find out yer hiding 'em, you're gonna be in fer a world of hurt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Threaten me all you want! All I have to do is call\r\n"
"the police and you'll be put away for good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Be my guest, Aragaki-san. We don't care. One of us gets the\r\n"
"slammer, and yer gonna be in the afterlife. In fact, that'd\r\n"
"solve our problem entirely!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Can't be yakuza if we're afraid of police and prison time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Urgh...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"But we're human, too. We don't enjoy killin' people just to\r\n"
"solve problems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"So how about just givin' us back them ledgers and none'll be the wiser?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "......!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Whatever you're trying to do, you need to give it up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"Yer that shithead from last time! This time, we'll shut yer ass up for good!"
msgstr ""

